WEBVTT

00:09:27.667 --> 00:09:32.684
and our poor brains treat
every single one of those threats

00:09:32.708 --> 00:09:35.518
as though they were a tiger.

00:09:35.542 --> 00:09:39.018
Our threat focus, our stress response,

00:09:39.042 --> 00:09:42.809
is permanently dialed up.

00:09:42.833 --> 00:09:46.226
Resilient people
don't diminish the negative,

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:49.101
but they also have worked out a way

00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:52.208
of tuning into the good.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:57.559
One day, when doubts
were threatening to overwhelm me,

00:09:57.583 --> 00:09:59.393
I distinctly remember thinking,

00:09:59.417 --> 00:10:04.559
"No, you do not get
to get swallowed up by this.